 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Popcorn, fruit salads, yogurt and cheese cubes can all stay out for a while. Add some crackers and you good for a basic packed lunch. If you buy it on the day, yes. If it' been standing in the sun, though, it can go off. Skip the chicken, keep the yogurt and crackers. Yes, a small cooler with some ice and a tray works well. Pack the chicken and any meat separately from the other foods. A small jar of jam or some fruit is perfect. Blend it with something creamy like yogurt and you got a nice balance.",
